OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F367A1786483115
OL,3,CTwo arrested over illegal waste
OL,4,Cdumping site on farmland
OL,6,FTwo men have been arrested as part of
OL,7,Fan investigation into illegal waste
OL,8,Fdumping on a farm.
OL,10,FThe Environment Agency were called to
OL,11,Fa large-scale illegal waste site at a
OL,12,Ffarm on Coal Pit Lane in Middlewich,
OL,13,FCheshire, on Friday 7 August.
OL,15,FConstruction waste, plastics, tyres,
OL,16,Fshredded waste and mixed household
OL,17,Fwaste were all discovered on farmland
OL,18,Fnext to the River Wheelock.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/4
