CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F367A1786483115
OL,3,CTwo arrested over illegal waste
OL,4,Cdumping site on farmland
OL,6,FWith help from Cheshire Police, a 69-
OL,7,Fyear-old local man was arrested on
OL,8,Fsuspicion of waste offences. He has
OL,9,Fsince been bailed.
OL,11,FIn a follow up operation on Monday 10
OL,12,FAugust, a second local man, 37, was
OL,13,Falso arrested at the same site on
OL,14,Fsuspicion of waste offences. He has
OL,15,Falso been bailed.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/4
