FL,368,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36703
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F367A1786483115
OL,3,CTwo arrested over illegal waste
OL,4,Cdumping site on farmland
OL,6,FCaroline Berry, Area Environment
OL,7,FManager for the Environment Agency,
OL,8,Fsaid:"Waste crime is a scourge on our
OL,9,Fenvironment and communities and
OL,10,Ftogether with the police we've made
OL,11,Farrests as part of this investigation.
OL,13,F"Waste criminals think they are above
OL,14,Fthe law and can do what they want,
OL,15,Fespecially on land they may own, but
OL,16,Fthey can be certain we are coming for
OL,17,Fthem."
OL,26,@pD@FOUuD@AOU
