PN,36704
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F367A1786483115
OL,3,CTwo arrested over illegal waste
OL,4,Cdumping site on farmland
OL,6,FSergeant Robert Simpson, of the Rural
OL,7,FCrime Team at Cheshire Police,
OL,8,Fadded:"Some people may believe that
OL,9,Fwaste crime does not harm anyone,
OL,10,Fhowever this is far from the truth.
OL,11,FNot only does it cause a blight on our
OL,12,Flandscape, but it can also cause long
OL,13,Flasting environmental damage.
OL,15,F"As part of the investigation into a
OL,16,Fsite in Middlewich, we have arrested
OL,17,Ftwo men, and we will be working
OL,18,Fclosely with our partners to ensure
OL,19,Fthose responsible are held accountable
OL,20,Ffor their actions."
OL,26,@pD@GOUwD@AOU
